{"step_index":1234,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-14T03:39:59Z","input_tokens":3068,"cache_read_tokens":245871,"output_tokens":590,"thinking":"Significant finding: `ws-company.co.kr` is registered to 주식회사더블유에스컴퍼니 with email `ws-company@naver.com`. The registration date is 2015.11.19, potentially aligning with the company's establishment, and the expiration is 2030.11.19, suggesting a long-term registration. Fetching the official website `http://ws-company.co.kr` appears logical next, focusing on its header, footer, and contact information.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"node -e \"\nasync function fetchWsSite() {\n  const urls = ['http://ws-company.co.kr', 'https://ws-company.co.kr'];\n  for (const u of urls) {\n    try {\n      const res = await fetch(u, {\n        headers: { 'User-Agent': 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36' }\n      });\n      console.log(u, '-> Status:', res.status);\n      const html = await res.text();\n      console.log('Len:', html.length);\n      const phones = html.match(/(?:051|02|070|01[016789])-[0-9]{3,4}-[0-9]{4}|1[568][0-9]{2}-[0-9]{4}/g);\n      console.log('Phones in ws-company.co.kr:', [...new Set(phones || [])]);\n      const clean = html.replace(/<[^>]+>/g, ' ').replace(/\\s+/g, ' ');\n      console.log('Snippet:', clean.substring(0, 1000));\n    } catch(e) {\n      console.log(u, '-> Err:', e.message);\n    }\n  }\n}\nfetchWsSite();\n\"","Cwd":"C:\\Users\\lg\\.gemini\\antigravity\\worktrees\\resilient-bardeen\\find_company_phone_numbers","IsDaemon":false,"WaitMsBeforeAsync":5000,"toolAction":"Fetching ws-company.co.kr site","toolSummary":"Fetch ws-company.co.kr official site"}}]}
